---
// LangModal Component — Language switcher panel
---
<div class="lang-modal-backdrop" id="langModal">
  <div class="lang-panel">
    <div class="lang-panel-header">
      <h3 class="lang-panel-title" data-i18n="langSelectorTitle">Seleccionar Idioma</h3>
      <button class="btn-close-lang" id="closeLangModal" aria-label="Cerrar">
        <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
          <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="lang-panel-desc" data-i18n="langSelectorDesc">
      Elige tu idioma de preferencia para explorar la plataforma.
    </p>
    <div class="lang-options-grid">
      <div class="lang-option-card active" data-lang="es">
        <div class="lang-option-left">
          <span class="lang-code-pill">ES</span>
          <span class="lang-option-name" data-i18n="langEs">Español (ES)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lang-check-radio"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="lang-option-card" data-lang="en">
        <div class="lang-option-left">
          <span class="lang-code-pill">EN</span>
          <span class="lang-option-name" data-i18n="langEn">English (US)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lang-check-radio"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
